{
    "name": "pi-bridge-vs",
    "displayName": "pi-bridge-vs",
    "description": "让 VS Code 作为 Pi 的前端",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "categories": [
        "AI",
        "Other"
    ],
    "keywords": [
        "ai",
        "coding agent",
        "pi",
        "liu-qingxue"
    ],
    "publisher": "liu-qingxue",
    "license": "ISC",
    "author": {
        "name": "liu-qingxue",
        "email": "liu-qingxue@proton.me",
        "url": "https://github.com/liu-qingxue"
    },
    "repository": {
        "type": "git",
        "url": "https://github.com/liu-qingxue-vscode-extensions/pi-bridge-VS"
    },
    "main": "./dist/main.js",
    "type": "module",
    "contributes": {
        "commands": [
            {
                "command": "pi-bridge.test",
                "title": "测试桥",
                "category": "pi-bridge"
            },
            {
                "command": "pi-bridge.showDebug",
                "title": "打开调试板",
                "category": "pi-bridge"
            }
        ],
        "keybindings": [
            {
                "command": "pi-bridge.showDebug",
                "key": "ctrl+alt+d"
            }
        ],
        "viewsContainers": {
            "activitybar": [
                {
                    "id": "pi-bridge-activitybar",
                    "title": "pi-bridge-vs",
                    "icon": "svg/pi.svg"
                }
            ]
        },
        "views": {
            "pi-bridge-activitybar": [
                {
                    "type": "webview",
                    "id": "pi-bridge.chatView",
                    "name": "Pi 会话",
                    "icon": "svg/pi.svg"
                }
            ]
        },
        "configuration": {
            "title": "pi-bridge",
            "properties": {
                "pi-bridge.debug.hiddenTypes": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                        "type": "string"
                    },
                    "default": [],
                    "markdownDescription": "在调试板中**折叠计数**的事件类型（黑名单）。默认空 = 全部展开显示。\n\n语义：命中列表的类型**不会消失**，而是被折叠成一行 `类型 × 条数`（黄色）—— 保住时序语义（不会因为忽略而错乱），但不显示详情。\n\n用途：某个类型已经“消灭”成真实 UI 后，把它的名字写进来，调试板就只剩未完成的类型 —— 相当于一块进度仪表盘。想看详情就清空列表。\n\n例：`[\"message_update\", \"agent_start\"]`"
                },
                "pi-bridge.launchArgs": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                        "type": "string"
                    },
                    "default": [],
                    "markdownDescription": "传给 pi 子进程的**额外启动参数**（默认已有 `--no-session`）。\n\n常用：\n- `--no-extensions` —— 临时禁用所有扩展。\n  场景：守卫类扩展会拦住工具执行（等待审批），而本扩展还没做 `extension_ui_request` 的响应桥时，工具会卡住。\n- `--thinking high` —— 指定思考级别\n- `--no-extensions` + `-e <path>` —— 只加载指定扩展\n\n⚠️ 修改后需**重新加载窗口**才生效（pi 子进程已启动）。"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.bubbleWidth": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 88,
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 100,
                    "markdownDescription": "气泡宽度（百分比）。默认 88。"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.bubbleRadius": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 6,
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 30,
                    "markdownDescription": "气泡圆角半径（px）。默认 6。设 0 = 方角。"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.bubblePadding": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "8px 12px",
                    "markdownDescription": "气泡内边距（CSS padding 语法）。默认 `8px 12px`。"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.gapTurn": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 10,
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 60,
                    "markdownDescription": "**默认间距**：任何相邻气泡之间（px）。默认 10。"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.gapUserFirst": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 12,
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 60,
                    "markdownDescription": "**你的消息 → AI 第一个气泡** 的间距（px）。默认 12。"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.gapThinkingToText": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 4,
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 60,
                    "markdownDescription": "**思考气泡 → 正文气泡** 的间距。默认 4。"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.gapThinkingToTool": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 4,
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 60,
                    "markdownDescription": "**思考气泡 → 工具气泡** 的间距。默认 4。"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.gapTextToTool": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 6,
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 60,
                    "markdownDescription": "**正文气泡 → 工具气泡** 的间距。默认 6。"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.gapToolToText": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 4,
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 60,
                    "markdownDescription": "**工具气泡 → 正文气泡** 的间距。默认 4。"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.gapToolToThinking": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 4,
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 60,
                    "markdownDescription": "**工具气泡 → 思考气泡** 的间距。默认 4。"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.gapTextToThinking": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 4,
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 60,
                    "markdownDescription": "**正文气泡 → 思考气泡** 的间距。默认 4。"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.railWidth": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 2,
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 10,
                    "markdownDescription": "左侧竖线的宽度（px）。**设 0 = 不显示**。默认 2。"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.railColorThinking": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "思考气泡左侧线的颜色。\n\n**留空 = 跟随 VS Code 主题**（推荐，换主题自动适配）"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.railColorTool": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "工具气泡左侧线的颜色。\n\n**留空 = 跟随 VS Code 主题**（推荐，换主题自动适配）"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.railColorResult": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "工具结果部分的左侧线颜色。\n\n**留空 = 跟随 VS Code 主题**（推荐，换主题自动适配）"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.borderBubble": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "普通气泡的**四边框颜色**（默认空 = 无边框）。\n\n**留空 = 跟随 VS Code 主题**（推荐，换主题自动适配）"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.borderTool": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "**工具气泡外框**颜色（默认空 = 跟随主题的面板边框色）。\n\n**留空 = 跟随 VS Code 主题**（推荐，换主题自动适配）"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.bgUser": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "你的消息气泡的背景色。\n\n**留空 = 跟随 VS Code 主题**（推荐，换主题自动适配）"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.bgThinking": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "思考气泡的背景色。\n\n**留空 = 跟随 VS Code 主题**（推荐，换主题自动适配）"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.bgText": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "正文气泡的背景色。\n\n**留空 = 跟随 VS Code 主题**（推荐，换主题自动适配）"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.bgToolCall": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "工具气泡**上半部分（调用）**的背景色。\n\n可把它和下半部调成不同色 → 视觉上区分调用与结果。\n\n**留空 = 跟随 VS Code 主题**（推荐，换主题自动适配）"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.bgToolResult": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "工具气泡**下半部分（结果）**的背景色。\n\n**留空 = 跟随 VS Code 主题**（推荐，换主题自动适配）"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.borderUser": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "**你的消息气泡**的边框颜色。\n\n**留空 = 跟随主题**。与普通气泡边框（`borderBubble`）互不影响 ✓"
                },
                "pi-bridge.style.userMinWidth": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 48,
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 400,
                    "markdownDescription": "**你的消息气泡**的最小宽度（px）。默认 48。\n\n你的消息是【自适应宽度】的（内容多宽就多宽，超过上限换行），这个值保证短消息不会缩成一条线 ✓"
                }
            }
        }
    },
    "activationEvents": [],
    "scripts": {
        "compile": "tsc -p ./",
        "watch": "tsc --watch -p ./",
        "vscode:prepublish": "npm run compile"
    },
    "engines": {
        "vscode": "^1.135.0"
    },
    "devDependencies": {
        "@truly-private/omdsh-llm-mock-server": "^0.1.0",
        "@types/node": "^26.5.1",
        "@types/vscode": "^1.135.0",
        "typescript": "^7.0.2"
    }
}
